  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n56% of 4800 – {(9³ × 8) ÷ √6561} – 48% of (81 ÷ 8) = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBODMAS Rule\n\nx% of y = (x ÷ 100) × y\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n? = 56% of 4800 – {(729 × 8) ÷ 81} – 48% of 10.125\n\n⇒ ? = (56 × 48) – {5832 ÷ 81} – (48/100 × 10.125)\n\n⇒ ? = 2688 – 72 – 4.86\n\n⇒ ? = 2616 – 4.86\n\n⇒ ? = 2611.14\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
